<title>UK: Lebanon sets 250 mln mark 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Lebanon sets 250 mln mark 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEBANON</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    17.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+175 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
